SDUSD::previewDeposit
├── when total supply and total assets are zero
│   └── it should preview shares at the initial ratio
├── when the vault has existing supply
│   └── it should return the same rounded-down amount as convertToShares
├── when a reward period is active
│   └── it should use only currently unlocked assets
├── when PAUSE_TYPE is paused
│   └── it should continue returning the mathematical preview
└── when the vault has received a raw DUSD donation
    └── it should ignore the donation in the preview
